{"id": "3098175", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3098175", "title": "WTA German Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "WTA German Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii iunie 2024. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Berlin, Germania, disputat pe terenuri cu iarb\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Caroline Garcia \u0219i Luisa Stefani au fost campioanele en-titre, \u00eens\u0103 Garcia n-a participat \u00een acest an. Stefani a juact al\u0103turi de Demi Schuurs, \u00eens\u0103 au pierdut \u00een semifinale \u00een fa\u021ba lui Wang \u0219i Zheng.\nWang Xinyu \u0219i Zheng Saisai au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la Berlin Ladies Open 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Chan Hao-ching \u0219i Veronika Kudermetova, cu 6\u20132, 7\u20135."}
